  "knownLimitations": [
    "The voice key only forwards audio to the virtual microphone while it is held; a short press does not start an app recording control.",
    "Home Alt+Tab does not keep the switcher open. An unwritten option is double-click Ctrl+Alt+Tab. Do not put this on long-press because of repeat.",
    "profile create may switch the active global profile to the newly created one; restore the intended active profile afterwards.",
    "Official default shortcuts will not match machines where the user remapped them.",
    "Mappings were checked by CLI readback, not by formal hands-on feel testing."
  ]
}
